  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch, leader of Spectral Soul’s first generation split souls, cultivated wisdom path and had to find a way to deal with heaven’s will. Using a part of the true inheritance of Star Constellation Immortal Venerable that they found, together with his wisdom path attainment, he devised a method: assimilate with heaven’s will.",
      "chapters": [
        1334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chen Yi has Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance, while Fairy Zi Wei cultivates Star Constellation’s true inheritance. It is not that Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance is inferior, but wisdom path killer moves are fundamentally more complex and expend much more mental energy, and Fairy Zi Wei displays rank eight expert might above Chen Yi.",
      "chapters": [
        1579
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-cultivation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_yi",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wisdom Gu was refined by Star Constellation Immortal Venerable. The refinement process is recorded in Star Constellation’s true inheritance, which is how Fairy Zi Wei knows a lot about it. She does not know that wisdom Gu has the trait of following after information path environments.",
      "chapters": [
        1580
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-gu-record",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_wisdom_gu",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei had little lifespan to begin with. She was lucky to have Star Constellation true inheritance helping her, but after facing Steal Life twice she is in a poor state, while Longevity Heaven’s Bull Demon and Flower Lady arrive in perfect condition and hold the advantage.",
      "chapters": [
        1583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lifespan-strain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_steal_life",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "char_bull_demon",
        "char_flower_lady"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Duke Long will not hand over Primordial Origin’s true inheritance, Fang Yuan asks what Heavenly Court can offer instead, naming Star Constellation’s or Genesis Lotus’ true inheritance. Either would be useful to him.",
      "chapters": [
        1839
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-offer",
